      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACKJACK BART (4) brings some decent form from Menangle, finishing third from a wide barrier two back then chasing well to be beaten less than 4m last week. Finds a suitable assignment and is going well enough to put himself into the winners' stall. ROCLEA IMAGE (2) has also been racing at Menangle where he beat Blackjart Bart for a win back in September and wasn't far behind that rival last start. Likely to get the favours from this draw. Primary contender. ALWAYSBMINNIE (3) draws well and looks close to a win after back-to-back seconds, beaten only 1.8m here before a good effort from the back line at her most recent appearance at Penrith. FLIPTOP BOTTLESHOP (1) came from wider when beaten just over a metre as runner-up here two weeks ago. Should get his chance from the ace draw.",
